OPT_LOG_WARNINGS    1 ! [D] Write warnings into log file? 1 -> yes, 0 -> no
OPT_PAUSE           0 ! [D] Pause at end of run with window open? 0 -> no, 1 -> yes
OPT_SKIP_INIT_DYN   0 ! [D] Skip initial dynamic calculations of outputs? 0 -> no, 1
